    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This simple sokoban style game player need push different color boxes to destined locations. Every color goes to same colored goals. So red box to red goal box.<br>Match the box colors to goal colors complete the level. Try to move as little as possible, as fast as possible and collect as many coins as you can<br> There is save system which save and register player fastest time, steps taken and collected coins. Also when finished level next level will be unlocked. 16 different levels<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>- 5 different colors boxes<br>- 16 levels with unlocked level system<br>- Steam achievements<br>- Collect coins<br>-  score and time system",
